\section{Overview}
\label{sup:overview}
This supplement holds the proofs, the calibration of the attack, the engine's
second defect and the realizability audit that the paper summarises. Section,
table and equation numbers prefixed with S refer to this document; all others
refer to the paper. Every number is generated from the released result files by
the same generators as the paper's.

